  "deactivated_at": "2026-08-30T16:13:36.686590+00:00",
  "detailed_description": "The scheme “Hybrid Chilli Production Program” launched by the Horticulture and Food Processing Department, Government of Madhya Pradesh, aims to provide financial assistance and inputs for hybrid chilli cultivation to Scheduled Caste farmers, thereby enhancing crop quality, productivity, and farmers’ income.\n<br>\n\n",
  "eligibility": "\n  - The applicant must be a farmer.\n  - The applicant must be a resident of Madhya Pradesh.\n  - The applicant must belong to the Scheduled Caste category.\n  - The applicant must belong to the Below the Poverty Line (BPL) category.\n\n<br>\n\n",
  "exclusions": null,
